X	podcasts-downloads	p	**Yes.** A downloaded episode is a copy for listening offline. Removing the download leaves the episode in its show, ready to stream or download again while the show still offers it.
X	podcasts-downloads	p	**What it costs you:** offline listening. Shows sometimes take old episodes down, so a download can be your last copy of one.
X	podcasts-downloads	p	**Does it come back?** Only if you download it again, or automatic downloads fetch new episodes, which is what fills the space up again.
