X	podcasts-downloads	li	2. For one episode: select the show, click the More button next to the episode, and choose **Remove Download**.
X	podcasts-downloads	li	3. For a whole show, or everything: click the More button at the top right of the show, or of Downloaded, choose **Remove All Downloads**, then confirm with Remove Downloads.
X	podcasts-downloads	p	Then keep them from piling up again, in Podcasts › Settings › General:
X	podcasts-downloads	li	- **Remove Played Downloads** deletes downloaded episodes automatically 24 hours after you play them.
X	podcasts-downloads	li	- **Automatically Download** can be turned off, or set to how many downloaded episodes to keep.
X	podcasts-downloads	li	- **Download When Saving** can be turned off if you save episodes as a list to come back to rather than for offline listening.
X	podcasts-downloads	p	Each show can also have its own settings: open the show, click the More button, then Settings. Removing downloads in Podcasts keeps its list of downloads right; deleting files in the folder by hand doesn’t.
