X	icloud-drive-local-files	p	**Only with Remove Download.** Deleting a file in iCloud Drive, from Finder or from its folder in your Library, deletes it from iCloud and every device signed in to your Apple Account. Removing the download frees the space on this Mac and leaves the file in iCloud.
X	icloud-drive-local-files	p	**What it costs you:** a removed download needs an internet connection, and a moment, the next time you open it.
X	icloud-drive-local-files	p	**Does it come back?** A removed download comes back when you open the file. A deleted file comes back only from Recently Deleted on iCloud.com, for 30 days.
