X	cursor-extensions	p	**No, not by hand.** `~/.cursor/extensions` holds every extension you installed in Cursor, and the folder around it keeps small files you want, like your global MCP servers in `mcp.json`. Uninstall the extensions you don’t use from Cursor’s Extensions panel instead.
