X	xcode-simulators	p	**Yes, with Xcode’s own tools.** Simulators for OS versions you’ve removed are dead weight, and ones you don’t use can go too. Delete them with Xcode or `xcrun simctl`, not in Finder, so CoreSimulator’s list of devices stays right.
X	xcode-simulators	p	**What it costs you:** the test apps and data on each simulator you delete. Simulator runtimes, the simulated OS versions, download again from Xcode if you need one back.
X	xcode-simulators	p	**Does it come back?** A simulator is added again in Xcode in moments, empty. A runtime comes back from Xcode › Settings › Components.
