X	xcode-simulators	code	xcrun simctl runtime list
X	xcode-simulators	h	How to clear it
X	xcode-simulators	p	**Simulators for OS versions you’ve removed.** They can’t run any more, so they can all go at once. Quit Simulator, then:
X	xcode-simulators	code	xcrun simctl delete unavailable
X	xcode-simulators	p	**Simulators you don’t use.** Take the UDID from `xcrun simctl list devices` and delete just that one:
