X	xcode-simulators	code	xcrun simctl runtime delete <runtime-id>
X	xcode-simulators	p	**SwiftUI preview simulators.** With Xcode quit, `xcrun simctl --set previews delete all` clears the preview device set; developers on Apple’s forums report previews working normally afterwards.
X	xcode-simulators	p	Avoid deleting folders inside `Devices` by hand. CoreSimulator keeps its own record of the devices it manages, and `simctl` removes the record and the folder together.
