X	bun-cache	p	**Yes, the cache part.** `~/.bun/install/cache` holds packages Bun downloaded, and `bun pm cache rm` empties it. The rest of `~/.bun` can be Bun itself and your global tools, so keep it.
X	bun-cache	p	**What it costs you:** the next `bun install` in each project downloads again. Projects set up with Bun’s global store also need that install before they run.
X	bun-cache	p	**Does it come back?** Yes, with every `bun install`.
