X	cargo-registry	code	rm -rf ~/.cargo/git/db/*
X	cargo-registry	p	The first two only cost re-extracting and checking out again, with no download. The last two mean downloading crates and cloning git dependencies again. The Cargo Book also mentions a third-party tool, `cargo-cache`, that shows the size of each part and clears them selectively.
