X	homebrew-cache	code	brew autoremove --dry-run
X	homebrew-cache	p	Don’t delete folders in the Cellar or the Caskroom by hand: Homebrew links each installed version into its `bin` and other folders, and `brew uninstall` is the way to remove a package you don’t need.
