X	pnpm-store	p	**Yes, by pruning it.** `pnpm store prune` removes packages no project on your Mac still uses, and pnpm’s docs call it harmless. Deleting the whole store by hand gains little and can bite.
X	pnpm-store	p	**What it costs you:** a pruned package downloads again if a project asks for it later.
X	pnpm-store	p	**Does it come back?** The store refills with every `pnpm install`, so prune it now and then.
X	pnpm-store	h	Measure it
